===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{taxlink|Lophophanes cristatus|species|noshow=1|ver=160930}}, a small bird of the [[tit]] family {{l|mul|Paridae}}, with an [[erectile]] [[crest]], the tip of which is often [[recurved]].

